Feature: The manual
  The DOCS screen opens this manual. From source, RENDER DOCS writes the manual again from the
  specs in `expectations/` and the last saved test results. RE-RUN TESTS + RENDER also runs
  the tests first. In the app bundle, the manual was written when the app was built, so these
  two buttons are not there.

  Expectation: RENDER DOCS writes the manual
    When the pilot renders the docs
    Then the program in the log is the manual build
